# The API build stamp (instance 32) — GENERATED at deploy time, NEVER committed.
# Committing it is circular: you stamp at commit A, commit the stamp, and now the
# tree that ships is A' while the stamp names A. `railway up` uploads the working
# directory, so an untracked-but-present stamp still ships.
# ⛔ If it turns out NOT to ship, production REFUSES TO START (no stamp under
# NODE_ENV=production) — loud, immediate, and impossible to mistake for working.
webv0/apps/api/buildStamp.json
